ern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,81,73,66,79,82],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"98","reputation":"11000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1010205","helmet":"WP1022705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,81,73,66,79,82],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"98","reputation":"11000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1010205","helmet":"WP1022705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,81,73,66,79,82],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"98","reputation":"11000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1010205","helmet":"WP1022705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,81,73,66,79,82],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"98","reputation":"11000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1010205","helmet":"WP1022705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,81,73,66,79,82],"title":-1,"rank":"3","loyalty":"98","reputation":"11000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1010205","helmet":"WP1022705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,81,73,66,79,82],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"99","reputation":"4550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1010205","helmet":"WP1022705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[80,81,73,66,79,82],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"99","reputation":"4550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1010205","helmet":"WP1022705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀汉大将。初为刘璋势力下的巴郡太守，擅用长弓与长刀，反对刘璋招刘备武将之一。所驻守巴郡遭张飞进攻期间闭城不出，因中张飞之计出城迎战，此时张飞攻至后方，严颜被围后遭其俘虏。对张飞怒言相加，拒不投降，反遭张飞致歉其无礼之处，并为严颜松绑，将其奉为上宾，严颜被张飞义气所动容而归降刘备。后出动请求为部队前锋，劝降路上其余刘璋部将，一路畅通无阻。刘备任益州牧后封严颜为前将军，后随刘备转战各地，在汉中战事中与黄忠一同活跃于前线，并于天荡山斩杀魏将夏侯德。","tc":"蜀漢大將。初為劉璋勢力下的巴郡太守，擅用長弓與長刀，反對劉璋招劉備武將之一。所駐守巴郡遭張飛進攻期間閉城不出，因中張飛之計出城迎戰，此時張飛攻至后方，嚴顏被圍后遭其俘虜。對張飛怒言相加，拒不投降，反遭張飛致歉其無禮之處，并為嚴顏松綁，將其奉為上賓，嚴顏被張飛義氣所動容而歸降劉備。后出動請求為部隊前鋒，勸降路上其余劉璋部將，一路暢通無阻。劉備任益州牧后封嚴顏為前將軍，后隨劉備轉戰各地，在漢中戰事中與黃忠一同活躍于前線，并于天蕩山斬殺魏將夏侯德。","en":"A great general of Shu Han. Originally Governor of Ba Commandery under Liu Zhang's faction, he was skilled with the longbow and long saber, and was one of the officers who opposed inviting Liu Bei. When Zhang Fei attacked Ba Commandery, Yan Yan stayed behind closed gates, but fell for Zhang Fei's stratagem and rode out to battle. Zhang Fei attacked his rear, surrounding and taking him captive. Yan Yan berated Zhang Fei in fury and refused to surrender, only for Zhang Fei to apologize for his rudeness, untie him, and treat him as an honored guest. Moved by Zhang Fei's righteousness, Yan Yan surrendered to Liu Bei. He then petitioned to serve as vanguard and persuaded Liu Zhang's remaining officers along the route to surrender, clearing the way ahead. After Liu Bei became Governor of Yi Province, he appointed Yan Yan Fore Commander. Yan Yan later followed Liu Bei across various campaigns, fighting actively on the frontline during the Hanzhong campaign alongside Huang Zhong, and slew the Wei officer Xiahou De at Mount Tiandang.","jp":"蜀漢の大将。当初は劉璋勢力下の巴郡太守を務め、長弓と長刀の扱いに長け、劉璋が劉備を招き入れることに反対した武将の一人であった。守備する巴郡を張飛に攻められた際は城を閉ざして籠城したが、張飛の計略にかかって出撃したところを後方に回り込まれて包囲され、捕虜となった。張飛に対して激しく怒声を浴びせて降伏を拒んだが、逆に張飛から無礼を詫びられて縄を解かれ、上客としてもてなされたことで、その義気に心を打たれて劉備に帰順した。その後は自ら願い出て軍の先鋒を務め、道中の劉璋配下の部将たちを説得して降伏させ、進軍路を切り開いた。劉備が益州牧となると前将軍に任じられ、以後は各地を転戦。漢中の戦いでは黄忠と共に前線で活躍し、天蕩山にて魏将の夏侯徳を討ち取った。","kr":"촉한의 대장이다. 처음에는 유장 세력 하의 파군태수로, 장궁과 장도를 능숙하게 다루었으며 유장이 유비를 맞아들이는 것을 반대한 무장 중 한 명이었다. 주둔하던 파군이 장비의 공격을 받자 성문을 굳게 닫고 출전하지 않았으나, 장비의 계책에 넘어가 성 밖으로 나와 맞서 싸우다 후방을 기습당해 포위된 끝에 포로로 사로잡혔다. 장비에게 크게 호통을 치며 완강히 항복을 거부했으나, 장비가 도리어 자신의 무례를 사과하고 결박을 풀어 상빈으로 극진히 예우하자, 그의 의기에 감복하여 유비에게 귀순하였다. 이후 스스로 군의 선봉에 서기를 청하여 진군로에 있던 유장의 부하 장수들을 설득해 항복시키며 거침없이 진격했다. 유비가 익주목이 된 후 엄안을 전장군으로 봉하였으며, 이후 유비를 따라 각지를 누비며 한중 전투에서 황충과 함께 전방에서 맹활약했고 천탕산에서 위나라 장수 하후덕을 참살했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10047","remark":"","surname":"严","surnameTc":"嚴","surnameEn":"Yan","surnameJp":"厳","surnameKr":"엄","surnameOther":"","name":"颜","nameTc":"顏","nameEn":"Yan","nameJp":"顔","nameKr":"안","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"严颜","power":"WJ10045","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1040","gender":"0","rule":"80","force":"81","wise":"73","politics":"66","charm":"79","will":"82","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"27/78/27/27/67/20/50/27","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1004102;1007202","battleSkill":"1006000;1002200","debateCard":"1005805;1002201","warSoul":"S1002205;S1003605","battleSoul":"1013605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6400","battleSoulPoint":"6500","debateSoulPoint":"5300","strategy":"1009315","strategy2":"1000705;1003015","professions":"3/2/0/4/2/0/2/1/0/1/4/4/4/1/2/2/0/2/3/1/1/3/1/